{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藍田匯景花園15座一個單位，今日（10日）中午12時22分發生火警，冒出濃煙。消防員接報到場開喉灌救，16分鐘後將火救熄。其間約50人自行疏散到安全地方，火警中無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"火警期間約50人疏散。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196813834288107520301952.jpeg/E_-dIjqbYEpt-jgjOo9H10nvB-hP7s_PWsxYpFrMWKQ\"/><figcaption>火警期間約50人疏散。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場灌救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196813832018857984912057.jpeg/UpDlc9XgOnJi9FI6Jt4rWJeqMUkN2PMrZS57smUue7I\"/><figcaption>消防員到場灌救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單位窗戶碎裂外牆熏黑。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196813829611196416624791.jpeg/mbwkho35SvLNLXavp0jcSuL0f_m1VCCQfemMsX3pjLE\"/><figcaption>單位窗戶碎裂外牆熏黑。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.181449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:19:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:02.840811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:02.840811+00:00","content_hash":"714368bc09e93f9562f187bdbd3c93e2d84f6812be94289a98349e33c898b77b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}